{19}{[The elf woman before you, upon seeing your mental state, seems almost physically repulsed.]  Ugghh.  Leave me alone.  I've nothing to say to the likes of you.}{[The elf woman before you, upon seeing your mental state, seems almost physically repulsed.]  Ugghh.  Leave me alone, woman.  I've nothing to say to the likes of you.}{}{3}{}{}
