{30}{What?  You, an outlander, dare to threaten a Dark Elf here, in T'sen-Ang?  I could have you killed on the spot for even thinking such a thing!  Perhaps I'll do it myself...}{What?  You, an outlander, dare to threaten a Dark Elf here, in T'sen-Ang?  I could have you killed on the spot for even thinking such a thing!  Perhaps I'll do it myself...}{}{5}{}{}
